# Best Practices

✔ Keep interfaces small and focused.

✔ One interface should represent one capability.

✔ Split large interfaces into multiple interfaces.

✔ Avoid forcing classes to implement unused methods.

✔ Prefer composition over oversized interfaces.

✔ Follow ISP to naturally satisfy LSP.

